    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d274-a1">

                <pb facs="0505" n="1465" sameAs="frus:frus1888p2/pg1465"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 322.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Moret to Mr. Curry.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ministry of
                            State</hi>, <lb/>
                        <placeName type="venue"><hi rendition="#italic">Palace</hi></placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1888-05-19"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >May</hi> 19, 1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: I have the honor of informing you
                    that the Spanish Chambers yesterday voted a resolution congratulating the Queen
                    Regent on the ovation she has received on her journey, and thanking the foreign
                    nations for the honor done to Spain by sending squadrons to the port of
                    Barcelona.</p>
                <pb facs="0506" n="1466" xml:id="pg1466"/>
                <p>As the United States has taken part, in this manifestation, so flattering for
                    Spain and for my august sovereign, I take pleasure in informing your excellency
                    of the above, and in requesting you to be good enough to bring it to the notice
                    of your Government.</p>
                <p>I avail, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">S. Moret.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
